{"id":4211,"date":"2024-05-31T19:53:05","date_gmt":"2024-05-31T18:53:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?page_id=4211"},"modified":"2024-07-02T17:26:22","modified_gmt":"2024-07-02T16:26:22","slug":"young-designers-award-terms-conditions","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/about\/young-designers-award-terms-conditions\/","title":{"rendered":""},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-spacer stk-block-spacer stk--no-padding stk-block stk-7eb34a4\" data-block-id=\"7eb34a4\"><style>.stk-7eb34a4{height:81px !important}<\/style><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-pink-color has-white-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:10px;font-size:3.7rem\">Young Designer&#8217;s Award<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-ce499ce\" data-block-id=\"ce499ce\"><style>.stk-ce499ce{margin-top:50px !important;margin-bottom:50px !important}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-ce499ce-column alignwide\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-ab4d633\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"ab4d633\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-ab4d633-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-ab4d633-inner-blocks\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Terms and Conditions<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Candidates must have the right to reside and work in the UK at the time the grant is awarded.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All successful applications will be subject to the candidate passing an enhanced DBS check for access to schools.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Applicants must hold a qualification in their discipline which allows them to practice professionally.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Candidates\u2019 personal data will be processed by CCAC in accordance with our&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/privacy-policy\/\">privacy policy<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Shortlisting of applicants will be conducted by a minimum of three CCAC trustee board members or Honorary Officer. Interviews will be conducted by two CCAC trustees or Honorary Officer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The&nbsp;value&nbsp;of the award is \u00a35,000.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This award cannot be transferred to any other individual or organisation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Successful candidates will familiarise themselves with CCAC\u2019s Code of Conduct Policy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Any severe infraction of the Code of Conduct policy may result in the award being withdrawn.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Applicants will be informed of the outcome of the selection process by email.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC\u2019s decision to award is final and we&nbsp;will not&nbsp;enter into discussion, explanation or correspondence about the reasons for our decision.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Applications close on Sunday 21 July at midnight.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Young Designer&#8217;s Award Terms and Conditions Candidates must have the right to reside and work in the UK at the time the grant is awarded. All successful applications will be subject to the candidate passing an enhanced DBS check for access to schools. Applicants must hold a qualification in their discipline which allows them to [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":2625,"menu_order":0,"comment_status